// Touch range, but narrowed to self exactly like nondetection.ron's own
// precedent: no touch-a-willing-ally targeting mechanism exists for a
// `SelfBuff`-shaped spell, and the sheet's own notes already call for the
// `SelfBuff` arm here ("Touch on a willing ally but functions as a
// defensive ward buff; SelfBuff arm chosen"). D&D's "sets base AC to 13 +
// Dex while unarmored" becomes the same flat `ProtectingWard` damage
// reduction this school's other AC-style wards use, held for the spell's
// full 8-hour duration.
SelfBuff(
    buildup_duration: 0.5,
    cast_duration: 0.2,
    recover_duration: 0.35,
    buffs: [
        BuffDesc(kind: ProtectingWard, data: BuffData(strength: 0.15, duration: Some(28800.0))),
    ],
    energy_cost: 20.0,
    meta: (school: Some(Abjuration), source: Some(Arcane)),
)
